@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
top to bottom direction

title DC-O12 — Submit a reviewed mail send/reply attempt
rectangle "BEFORE / ELIGIBILITY\nFinal intended message reviewed; actual\nsend authority current" as Before
rectangle "CONFIRMED SUCCESS ONLY\nAttributable provider acceptance only if\nactually confirmed" as After
rectangle "FRAME / PROTECTED MEANING\nNo inferred recipient delivery/read;\nunknown acceptance is not safe resend" as Frame #DFF1EA
Before --> After : DC-O12\npermitted effect actually confirmed
After -[hidden]down-> Frame
note bottom of Before
Current exact authority and full preconditions apply.
This is a logical contract relation, not execution order.
end note
note bottom of Frame
If effect is partial, pending or unknown, do not claim After.
Use same-operation evidence/reconciliation (DC-O38).
Frame constrains this operation, not independent concurrent work.
end note
legend bottom
Full inputs, pre/postconditions, frame, exceptions and policy status are in document 10.
Accepted profile core remains accepted; other detail is a proposed analysis refinement.
No transaction, implementation component, rollback or deployment authority is selected.
endlegend
@enduml
